Subject: Accept the Macintosh Hexen CD's Hexen.WAD as hexen.wad?mac

The Macintosh CD's Hexen.WAD (21078584 bytes, md5
b68140a796f6fd7f3a5d3226a32b93be) is the 1.1 game (the same maps, sounds,
music lumps and graphics) plus Macintosh fonts and menu art, and it has no
GENMIDI and DMXGUS lumps (the DOS sound driver's instrument banks). gdp
did not know it, so it gave nothing from a Mac CD. It is now an
alternative of hexen.wad. Engines that need GENMIDI for their OPL player
(DSDA-Doom before our patch) stop at start with this WAD; those that only
play MIDI through another device are fine.

Forwarded: not yet (candidate for Debian)

diff --git a/data/hexen.yaml b/data/hexen.yaml
